ls which provide economic outlook of future gas prices that have most closely followed the historical trend of Oklahoma gas prices.  To determine the ave
rage differential between the published forecasted prices and Oklahoma gas prices, the Tax Commission shall compare prices in at least twenty-four (24) of the immediate thirty-six (36) previous months of production.  The Tax Commission shall utilize the p
rocedures provided herein to forecast the collection of gross production tax revenues from the production of natural and casinghead gas for the fiscal year beginning July 1, 2005, and each fiscal year thereafter.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
