\f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid14973110 T
he Oklahoma Tax Commission is authorized to enter into an agreement to compound, settle or compromise any controversy relating to taxes collectible by the Tax Commission, or any admitted or established tax liability as to any tax collectible under any Sta
te Law in the following cases:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14973110 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid14973110 
