ation deemed necessary to determine the amount of state tax liability.  Notwithstanding Section 205 of this title the Commission shall have the power to compel the production of books, records or papers of any person, firm, association, partnership, corpo
ra
tion or other legal entity regarding the business, property, assets or effects of any Oklahoma taxpayer which may be necessary to a determination of state tax liability of such taxpayer, including any books, records or papers necessary to obtain or verify
