ahoma Statutes, medical marijuana gross receipts tax collected pursuant to Sections 420 through 426.1 of Title 63 of the Oklahoma Statutes, withheld income taxes or motor fuel taxes collected pursuant to Article 5, 6 or 7 of this title, the Commission sha
ll file such proposed assessments against the individuals personally liable for the tax.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5260990 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5260990 
