 was responsible for withholding or collection and remittance of taxes or had direct control, supervision or responsibility for filing returns and making payments of the tax due the State of Oklahoma.
\par C.  Personal liability for sales tax, mixed beverage gross receipts tax, medical marijuana gross receipts tax, withheld income tax or motor fuel tax shall be determined in accordance with the standards for determining liability for payment of federal with
