\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid925797 \rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs40\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218044068}\'a768-331.  Sales by a wholesaler to a sub-jobber.{\*\bkmkend _Toc218044068}
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9707793 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 W
hen a wholesaler sells cigarettes and/or tobacco products to a sub-jobber, the former shall use the basic cost of cigarettes and/or tobacco products (which is the factory list, less all discounts except customary discounts for cash, plus the full face val
ue of any stamps which may be required by any cigarette tax act of this State now in effect or hereafter enacted) in making such sales.  The sub-jobber, upon resale to a retailer, shall be subject to the provisions of Section 4 of this act.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9707793 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by Laws 1949, p. 109, \'a7 6, emerg. eff. May 31, 1949.  Renumbered from Title 15, }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 \'a7}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436  599.6 by Laws 1981, c. 211, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 \'a7}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
 7, emerg. eff. June 1, 1981.
