\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid925797 \rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs40\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218044069}\'a768-332.  Sales by a wholesaler to a wholesaler.{\*\bkmkend _Toc218044069}
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11293322 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 W
hen one wholesaler sells cigarettes and tobacco products to any other wholesaler, the former shall not be required to include in his selling price to the latter "cost to the wholesaler", as provided by Section 4 of this act, but the latter wholesaler, upo
n resale to a retailer, shall be subject to the provisions of said section: Provided further, that manufacturer's representatives, manufacturer's salesmen, or any other person not coming under the definition of a wholesaler, shall not be eligible to purch
as
e cigarettes or tobacco products under the provisions of this Section. Sales by manufacturer's representatives, manufacturer's salesmen, or any other person selling cigarettes and tobacco products to retailers or consumers, as the case may be, shall be re
quired to sell at prices no lower than the prices of the wholesaler to the retailer or of the retailer to the consumer, as the case may be.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11293322 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by Laws 1949, p. 109, \'a7 7, emerg. eff. May 31, 1949.  Renumbered from Title 15, }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 \'a7}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436  599.7 by Laws 1981, c. 211, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 \'a7}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
 7, emerg. eff. June 1, 1981.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14766238 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid925797 \rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs40\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218044070}\'a768-333.  Combination sales.{\*\bkmkend _Toc218044070}
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14766238 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 I
n all advertisements, offers for sale or sales involving two (2) or more items, at least one of which items or cigarettes and tobacco products, at a combined price, and in all advertisements, offers for sale, or sales, involving the giving of any gift or 
concession of any kind whatsoever (whether it be coupons or otherwise), the retailer's or wholesaler's combined selling price shall not be below the "cost to the retailer" or the "cost to the wholesaler", respectively, of the total of all articles, produc
