\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2239821 6.  "Unstamped cigarettes" means packages of cigarettes which bear no evidence of }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3954441 the}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2239821  tax stamp required by state law }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3954441 
and includes cigarettes bearing an improper tax stamp applicable to the retail establishment at which the cigarette is sold, regardless of the identity of the establishment which the cigarette has been sold, shipped, consigned or delivered}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2239821 ;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \highlight7\insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2239821 
7.  "Contraband cigarettes" means unstamped cigarettes which are required by the provisions of Sections 348 through 351 of this title or Section 301 et seq. of this title to bear stamps and which are in the possession, custody or control of any person, fo
r the purpose of being consumed, sold, offered for sale or consumption or transported to any person in this state other than a wholesaler licensed under Sect
ion 304 of this title; provided, contraband cigarettes shall not include unstamped cigarettes sold to veterans' hospitals, to state-operated domiciliary homes for veterans or to the United States for sale or distribution by said entities in accordance wit
h Sections 321 through 324 of this title;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2239821 8.  "Stamped cigarettes" means packages of cigarettes which bear }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3954441 the proper}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid11747436\charrsid2239821  tax stamp required by state law;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2239821 9.  "Commission" means the Oklahoma Tax Commission; and}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2239821 10.  "Person" shall include any individual, compan
y, partnership, joint venture, joint agreement, association (mutual or otherwise), limited liability company, corporation, trust, estate, business trust receiver or trustee appointed by any state or federal court, syndicates or any combination acting as a
 unit, in the plural or singular number.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
