s brand families that are sold in Oklahoma shall bear joint and several liability with such nonparticip
ating manufacturer for deposit of all escrow due, payment of all penalties imposed and payment of all costs and attorney fees imposed under Sections 600.21 through 600.23 of Title 37 of the Oklahoma Statutes and the Master Settlement Agreement.}{
