\par 2.  Under paragraph 3 of Section 10 of this act, shall be perfected by the exporter by a refund claim if the claim in the aggregate month to date exceeds One Thousand Dollars ($1,000.00) upon a refund application made to the Commission with
in three (3) years; or
\par 3.  Under paragraph 2 of Section 10 of this act, shall be perfected by the unlicensed exporter, if a diversion by an unlicensed exporter, upon a refund application made to the Commission within three (3) years.
