urchaser status under Section 23 of this act, may in the alternative elect to make payme
nt of the tax calculated pursuant to the final report provided in Section 40 of this act if the tax is paid in two equal installments beginning twelve (12) months after the effective date of this act and subject to regulations promulgated by the Commissio
n.
