tained by the Corporation Commission and apportioned as provided in Section 1167 of }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2706997 Title 47 of the Oklahoma Statutes}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid11747436\charrsid3868664 .  Fifteen Dollars ($15.00) of the fee shall be paid to the State Treasurer for deposit in the General Revenue Fund.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3868664 
