\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 The following words and phrases when used in this act are hereby defined as follows:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4004510 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 
(a)  The term "motor vehicle" or "vehicle" means and includes any automobile, truck, truck-tractor, bus, vehicle or mechanical contrivance which is propelled by an internal combustion engine or motor and not used in the air or upon fixed rails or tracks.}
{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 (b)  The term "person" means and includes every natural person, fiduciary, individual, partnership, firm, association, limited liability company, corporation, business trust
, or combination acting as a unit, or any receiver appointed by any state or federal court, and the use of the singular number shall include the plural.  Whenever used in any clause prescribing and imposing a fine or imprisonment or both, the term "person
" as applied to an association means and includes the parties or members thereof, and as applied to corporations, the officers thereof.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 (c)  "Commission" or "Tax Commission" means the Oklahoma Tax Commission.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 (d)  The term "special fuel" or "fuel" means and
 includes all combustible gases and liquids, including liquefied gases, which exist in the gaseous state at a temperature of sixty (60) degrees Fahrenheit and at a pressure of fourteen and seven-tenths (14.7) pounds per square inch absolute, but the term 
does not include compressed natural gas subject to the levy of tax pursuant to paragraph 3 of subsection A of Section 500.4 of this title or liquefied natural gas subject to the levy of tax pursuant to paragraph 4 of subsection A of Section 500.4 of this 
title.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 
(e)  The term "use" shall mean and include the following:  (1) the delivery or placing of special fuel into the fuel supply tank or tanks of any motor vehicle in this state for use in whole or in part to propel such vehicle on the public highways of this 
state; (2) the consumption on the public highways of Oklahoma of any special fuel imported into this state in the fuel supply tank or tanks of any motor vehicle using the public highways of this state for commercial purposes; (3) the consumption of spe
cial fuel in any type of motor vehicle on the public highways of this state for any purpose by any person who refuses to divulge the source of such fuel.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 
(f)  The term "public highway" means and includes every road, highway, street, way or place within this state, of whatever nature, generally open to the use of the public as a matter of right for the purposes of vehicular travel, including a toll highway,
 and including streets and alleys of any town or city, notwithstanding that the same may be temporarily closed for the purpose of construction, reconstruction, maintenance, or repair.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 (g)  The term "gallon" means one (1) United States standard gallon at a temperature of sixty (60) degrees Fahrenheit.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 
(h)  The term "special fuel dealer" shall mean any person engaged in the business of handling special fuel who delivers any part thereof into the fuel supply tank or tanks of any motor vehicle.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5326925 (i)  The term "special fuel user" shall mean and include any person other than a special fuel dealer, who uses special 
fuel in this state, within the meanings of the word "use" as defined in this act, and shall include any person who consumes special fuel to propel a motor vehicle upon the public highways of this state when such special fuel has been purchased or obtained
 from any source free from the payment to this state of the tax levied by this act.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4004510 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid16268723 
