e to furnish any other evidence or information which the Tax Commission may require; or who shall fail or ref{\*\xmlopen\xmlns2{\factoidname PersonName}}us{\*\xmlclose}
e to answer any competent questions which may be put to him or her by the Tax Commission, touching the b{\*\xmlopen\xmlns2{\factoidname PersonName}}us{\*\xmlclose}
