"economically at-risk oil or gas lease" means any oil or gas lease with one or more producing wells with an average production volume per well of ten (10) barrels of oil or sixty (60) MCF or less of natural gas per day operated at a net loss or at a net p
rofit which is less than the total gross production tax remitted for such lease during the previous calendar year, and any oil lease}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid4596819  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 
