\par 1.  Costs}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436  incurred in producing the gas;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid10365706 
