mmission's receipt therefor shall be accepted in lieu of money in settlement of the purchase price of such production; and whenever any such oil, gas or other minerals are assigned as security for debt or otherwise, such tax shall be likewise paid by such
 assignee; and such tax shall constitute a lien upon the interest assigned, which shall be paramount to such indebtedness for which the assignment is made; and whenever such tax shall become delinquent, the usual penalty shall apply.
