x levied by Section 1001 et seq. of this title may file semiannual reports and remit taxes due thereunder to the Tax Commission on or before the first day of January and July of each year for the preceding six-month period.  If not received on or before t
he last day of such month, the report and tax shall be delinquent.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
