unt of the bond required by the Tax Commission by the amount of the one-time payment.  If the bond posted is equal to or less than the amount of the payment, the tax remitter shall be relieved from the bond requirement, upon request.  The tax remitter sha
ll neither deduct nor otherwise collect all or any portion of the one-time payment from any person or entity entitled to the proceeds of production from an oil or gas lease in the State of Oklahoma.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 

