and the provisions requiring the producer to pay the royalty owner's tax, in no wise releases the producer or purchaser from liability to pay same, in all cases where such tax is not paid.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9256861 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Laws 1963, c. 365, \'a7 2; Laws 1965, c. 215, \'a7 2.
