\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2736\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2736\itap0\pararsid8810751 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid8810751 (1)\tab 
packaging such as containers, boxes, sacks, bags, and bottles, or other materials such as wrapping, labels, tags, and instruction guides, that accompany the retail sale of the products and are incidental or immaterial to the retail sale thereof, inclu
ding but not limited to, grocery sacks, shoeboxes, dry cleaning garment bags and express delivery envelopes and boxes,
\par (2)\tab a product provided free of charge with the required purchase of another product.  A product is provided free of charge if the sales price of the product purchased does not vary depending on the inclusion of the product provided free of charge, or

\par (3)\tab items included in the definition of gross receipts or sales price, pursuant to this section,
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2016\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2016\itap0\pararsid8810751 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid8810751 b.\tab \'93one nonitemized price\'94
