apability to determine whether the transaction is taxable or tax exempt, the appropriate tax rate applied to the transaction, and the total tax due on the transaction, and shall provide a method for collecting and remitting sales and use taxes to the stat
e.  Such system may provide compensation for the costs of collecting and remitting sales and use taxes.  Discussions between the Tax Commission and other states may include, but are not limited to:
