\par B.  The liability of this state to make rebate payments pursuant to the program created in Section 1357.21 of Title 68 of the Oklahoma Statutes shall be limited to the balance of the Oklahoma Broadband Rebate Revolving Fund.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 
