\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436  - }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3215097 Additional informational returns}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 .{\*\bkmkend _Toc218044516}
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10636066 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid11747436 A
.  The Oklahoma Tax Commission shall allow any Model 1, Model 2 or Model 3 seller, as defined in Section 1354.15 of Title 68 of the Oklahoma Statutes, to submit its sales and use tax returns in a simplified format.  The Tax Commission shall promulgate rul
es providing for the format in accordance with the Streamlined Sales and Use Tax Agreement.  The Tax Commission is further authorized to promulgate rules requiring these sellers to file additional informational returns.  Provided, the informational return
s may not be required more frequently than every six (6) months.
\par B.  All remittances from sellers under Models 1, 2 and 3 shall be remitted electronically.
\par C.  Any seller that is registered under the Agreement, which does not have a legal requirement to register in this state, and is not a Model 1, Model 2 or Model 3 seller, shall submit its sales and use tax returns as follows:
\par 1.  Upon registration, the Tax Commission shall provide to the seller the returns required by this state;
\par 2.  The seller shall file a return within one year of the month of initial registration, and on an annual basis in succeeding years; and
\par 3.  In addition to the returns required in paragraph 2 of this subsection, a seller shall submit returns in the month following any month in which the seller has accumulated state and local tax funds for the state in the amount of One Thousand Dollars ($1
,000.00) or more.
\par D.  The Tax Commission shall participate with other states which are members of the Agreement in developing a more uniform sales and use tax return that, when completed, would be available to all sellers.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 

