\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid8993013 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218044530}\'a768-1370.5.  County sales tax - Levy of tax on gross proceeds or receipts derived from certain consumer sales and services to fund economic development projects.}{
