\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3107800 As used in this act:
\par 1.  "Affiliated person" means a person that, with respect to another person:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2016\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2016\itap0\pararsid3107800 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3107800 a.\tab 
has a direct or indirect ownership interest of more than five percent (5%) in the other person, or
\par b.\tab is related to the other person because a third person, or group of third persons who are affiliated with each other as defined in this subsection, holds a direct or indirect ownership interest of more than five percent (5%) in the related person;

\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3107800 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3107800 2.  "Forum" means a place where sales at retail occur, whether 
