\par b.\tab either directly or indirectly through agreements or arrangements with third parties, collects the payment from the purchaser and transmits the payment to the person selling the property.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3107800 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid3107800 The term includes a person that may also be a vendor;
