tion 1357 of this title, as applicable to the use tax imposed by law, there shall be made a use tax refund for state and local taxes paid by a qualified purchaser for the purchase of such items.
\par B.  The Oklahoma Tax Commission shall transfer each month from use tax collected the amount which the Commission estimates to be necessary to make the use tax refund provided by this section to an account designated as the Commission determines.
