edure Act.  It shall be the duty of all sheriffs, constables and other peace officers to cooperate with the Oklahoma Tax Commission in the enforcement of the seizure and forfeiture provisions of this section.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 
