1.  "Fireworks" means any composition or device for the purpose of producing a visible or an audible effect by combustion, explosion, deflagration or detonation, and which are further described as Consumer Fireworks 1.4G, Display Fireworks 1.3G, Articles,
 Pyrotechnic 1.4G or 1.4S as defined by the United States Department of Transportation (DOT) Title 49, CFR.  The term "consumer fireworks" shall not include toy cap pistols and caps, blank cartridges, railroad f
lares and model rockets or any novelty.  This provision shall not impose labeling requirements for any fireworks or novelties other than those required under federal law;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid15290465 
2.  "Consumer Fireworks" means any devices suitable for use by the public that conform with the requirements of the United States Consumer Products Safety Commission (CPSC) and are designed primarily to produce visible effects by combustion, and some smal
l devices designed to produce an audible effect;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid15290465 3.  "Display Fireworks" means firewor
ks devices that are primarily intended for commercial displays which are designed to produce visible and/or audible effects by combustion, deflagration or detonation.  Display Fireworks include, but are not limited to, salutes containing more than two gra
ins (130mg) of explosive composition, aerial shells containing more than forty (40) grams of pyrotechnic compositions and other exhibition display items that exceed the limits for Consumer Fireworks according to the Department of Transportation (DOT);}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid15290465 4.  "Manufacturer" means any person engaged in the making or constructing of fireworks;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid15290465 
5.  "Novelty" means a device containing small amounts of pyrotechnic and/or explosive composition.  Such devices produce limited visible or audible effects.  These items must be approved by the United States Department of Transportation (DOT) or have been
 deregulated by DOT;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid15290465 6.  "Distributor" means any person who sells fireworks and novelties to other distributors, wholesalers or retailers for resale or provides them as part 
of a pyrotechnic display service in the State of Oklahoma;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid15290465 7.  "Wholesaler" means any person who purchases fireworks and novelties for resale only to retailers and consumers;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid15290465 8.  "Retailer" means any person who purchases fireworks and novelties for resale to consumers only; and}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid15290465 9.  "Person" means any corporation, association, partnership or one or more individuals.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6697556 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by Laws 1969, c. 337, \'a7 2, operative June 1, 1969.  Amended by Laws 1981, c. 268, 
