f Display Fireworks shall be required to comply with the standards promulgated by the National Fire Protection Agency, Section 1124}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 -}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid294521 
