Upon written request of a Display Fireworks manufacturer, the State Fire Marshal shall, within ten (10) days, conduct a fire and safety inspection and shall, upon satisfactory inspection, issue certification of the inspection.  Thereafter, the State Fire 
Marshal shall conduct a fire and safety inspection at least once every six (6) months.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid294521 Whenever the State Fire Marshal shall find any violation of NFPA}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 -}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid11747436\charrsid294521 
1124 which would endanger persons or property, the State Fire Marshal shall immediately order the manufacturing facility closed until such time as the violations are remedied and a new inspection and certification takes place.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid294521 
