ng facility shall, upon conviction, be guilty of a misdemeanor and be punished by imprisonment in the county jail not exceeding one (1) year or by a fine not exceeding Ten Thousand Dollars ($10,000.00) or both such fine and imprisonment.}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
