\par 2.  "Resident contractor" means a contractor who maintains his principal place of business in this state or a multi state employer who maintains a permanent work force of three or more employees in this state;
\par 3.  "Nonresident contractor" means a contractor who maintains his principal place of business outside this state or a multi state employer who does not maintain a permanent work force of three or more employees in this state.
