f Title 47 of the Oklahoma Statutes.  Manufactured home shall not mean a park model recreational vehicle as defined in Section 1102 of Title 47 of the Oklahoma Statutes;
\par 12.  The term \'93farm tractor\'94 means and includes any vehicle of tractor type owned and operated by the purchaser and used exclusively for agricultural purposes;
\par 13.  The term \'93all-terrain vehicle\'94 means and includes every vehicle defined as an all-terrain vehicle in Section 1102 of Title 47 of the Oklahoma Statutes;
\par 14.  The terms \'93legal ownership\'94 and \'93legally owned\'94 mean the right to possession, whether acquired by purchase, barter, exchange, assignment, gift, operation of law, or in any other manner;
\par 15.  The term \'93person\'94
 means and includes natural persons, individuals, partnerships, firms, associations, limited liability companies, corporations, estates, trustees, business trusts, syndicates, this state, any county, city, municipality, school distri
ct or other political subdivision of the state, or any corporation or combination acting as a unit or any receiver appointed by any state or federal court; and the use of the singular number shall include the plural number;
\par 16.  The term \'93utility vehicle\'94 means every vehicle defined as a utility vehicle in Section 1102 of Title 47 of the Oklahoma Statutes; and
