 Service Oklahoma, and shall at the same time in case of failure to pay, seize and hold the vehicle, as now provided by law in case of failure to pay the annual vehicle license or registration fee.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6322904 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid6322904 B.  Service Oklahoma shall, upon demand of the owner of the
