ring and directing the sale of such vehicle according to the same procedure now provided by law for the sale of vehicles for failure to pay the annual license fee.  Such seizure and sale may at the time include both the registration fee due and the excise
 tax levied by this article, together with all costs of advertisement and sale.  The sale shall be conducted in all manner as provided by law for the sale of personal property under execution.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
