ome and to the second and third taxable period thereafter to the extent not previously taken in the earliest successive taxable year.  In no event shall the deduction allowed under this section be carried back or applied against income for years prior to 
the effective date of this act or carried forward to any taxable year subsequent to the third full taxable year following the effective date hereof.
