\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid9122897 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218044688}\'a768-2355.1P-4.  Calculation of tax.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkend _Toc218044688}
