sions of this section or is hereafter found guilty in a court of competent jurisdiction of any violation of any Oklahoma income tax law shall not be eligible for the tax credit granted in Section 2357.7 of this title.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
