\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 A.  For tax years beginning after December 31, 2000, and ending before}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5394060  January 1, 2009}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
, there shall be allowed to an investor making an eligible investment a credit against the tax imposed by Section 2355 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5394060 or 2370}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436  of }{
