\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid7764875 2.  The credit shall only be available if the total cost of the new qualified recycling facility exceeds Twenty Million Dollars ($20,000,000.00) and employs at least sev
