\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid1448975 
1.  The Oklahoma small business venture must issue its equity securities or subordinated debt instruments in exchange for a qualified investment within thirty (30) days of the date as of which the investment occurs;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid11747436 
