ing an investment in conjunction with investment by a qualified small business capital company pursuant to Section 2357.63 of this title must reflect the documented qualified investment in the Oklahoma small business venture as an asset in its accounting 
system;}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid1448975 
3.  The qualified small business capital company shall not make a qualified investment in an Oklahoma small business venture in which it has, at any time, more than fifty percent (50%) ownership, whether directly or indirectly, of the voting interes
