{\*\xmlclose}ic CDs, radio commercials, jingles, cues, or electronic device recordings;
\par 3.  "Production company" means a person who produces a film or music project for exhibition in theaters, on television or elsewhere;
\par 4.  "Total production cost" includes, but is not limited to:
