e with such provisions of law, the Oklahoma Tax Commission is hereby directed to include a line for the remittance of use tax on individual income tax returns for tax years beginning on or after July 1, 2003.
\par B.  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid6388708 The Tax Commission shall include the following information in the income tax form instructions:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
