\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5388417 
2.  Thirty-five percent (35%) shall be apportioned to each municipality and county that levies a use tax, in the proportions which total municipal and county use tax revenue was apportioned by the Tax Commission in the preceding month.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
