\par 2.  \'93Approved company\'94 means any eligible company or companies seeking to undertake a tourism attraction project and is approved by the Executive Director pursuant to Sections 2395 and 2396 of this title;
\par 3.  \'93Approved costs\'94 means:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2016\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2016\itap0\pararsid13242593 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid13242593 a.\tab 
