all costs required for the installation of utilities in connection with a tourism attraction project including, but not limited to, water, sewer, sewage treatment, gas, electricity and communications, and including off-site construction of utility exte
nsions paid for by the approved company, and
\par g.\tab all other costs comparable with those described in this paragraph;
