\par 10.  \'93Inducements\'94 means the sales tax credit or incentive payment as prescribed in Section 2397 of this title;
\par 11.  \'93Preliminary approval\'94 means the action taken by the Executive Director conditioned upon final approval by the Executive Director upon satisfaction by the eligible company of the requirements of the Oklahoma Tourism Development Act;
