the facilities constitute a portion of a tourism attraction project and represent less than fifty percent (50%) of the total approved costs of the tourism attraction project, or
\par (b)\tab the lodging facilities are a part of a destination hotel or an Entertainment District,
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2736\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2736\itap0\pararsid13242593 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid13242593 (2)\tab 
facilities that are primarily devoted to the retail sale of goods, unless:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li3456\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin3456\itap0\pararsid13242593 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid13242593 (a)\tab 
the goods are created at the site of the tourism attraction project, or
\par (b)\tab if the sale of goods is incidental to the tourism attraction project, or
\par (c)\tab such facilities are a part of an Entertainment District,
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2736\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2736\itap0\pararsid13242593 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid13242593 (3)\tab 
facilities that are not open to the general public, unless such facilities are a part of an Entertainment District wherein a substantial portion of the Entertainment District is open to the general public, as determined by the Executive Director,
\par (4)\tab 
facilities that do not serve as a likely destination where individuals who are not residents of this state would remain overnight in commercial lodging at or near the tourism attraction project, unless such facilities are a part of an Entertainment Di
strict,
\par (5)\tab facilities owned by the State of Oklahoma or a political subdivision of this state, or
\par (6)\tab facilities esta
blished for the purpose of conducting legalized gambling.  However, a facility regulated under the Oklahoma Horse Racing Act, Sections 200 through 209 of Title 3A of the Oklahoma Statutes, shall be a tourism attraction for purposes of the Oklahoma Tourism
 Development Act for any approved project as outlined in subparagraph a of this paragraph or for an approved project relating to pari-mutuel racing at the facility and not for establishing a casino or for offering casino-style gambling; and
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13242593 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid13242593 13.  \'93Tourism attraction project\'94 or \'93project\'94 means:

