the acquisition including the acquisition of real estate by leasehold interest with a minimum term of ten (10) years, construction and equipping of a tourism attraction, and
\par b.\tab the construction and installation of improvements to facilities necessary or desirable for the acquisition, construction and installation of a tourism attraction, including, but not limited to:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2736\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2736\itap0\pararsid13242593 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid13242593 (1)\tab surveys, and
\par (2)\tab installation of utilities, which may include:
