\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5530618 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218045058}\'a768-2702.  Contractual agreements to collect taxes and enforce and assess penalties by Tax Commission - Tax Commission Compliance Fund.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 
