\par 2.  "Any year when title to the property is transferred, changed, or conveyed to another person or when improvements have been made to the property" means the year next preceding the January 1 assessment date;
\par 3.  "Improvement" means a valuable addition made to property amounting to more than normal repairs, replacement, 
