used by rain, strong winds, tornadic winds, hail, fire or any other natural disaster or other event causing damage and any such improvements made shall be disregarded for purposes of determining the maximum amount of fair cash value subject to ad valorem 
ta
xation pursuant to Section 8B of Article X of the Oklahoma Constitution unless the improvements increase the square footage in which case only additional square footage may be considered an "improvement".  If improvements constitute an increase in square 
