\par e.\tab deeds of release of property which is security for a debt or other obligation,
\par f.\tab deeds of partition, unless, for consideration, some of the parties take shares greater in value than their undivided interests,
\par g.\tab deeds made pursuant to mergers of partnerships, limited liability companies or corporations, or deeds pursuant to which property is transferred from a person to a partnership, limited lia
