\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 E
ach county assessor shall keep such books and records as are required by the rules and regulations of the Oklahoma Tax Commission including, but not limited to, publications provided by the Oklahoma Tax Commission to assist the assessor and appraisal staf
f in the valuation of taxable property as required by law.
