\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 E
very transmission company doing business in this state shall return sworn lists or schedules of its taxable property to the Oklahoma Tax Commission, and such lists or schedules shall show the total length of line in each county, school district or other s
ubdivision of the state, total number of wires to each line and total number of poles per mile, the total number of instruments in each municipal subdivision, the total amount of office furniture and the total amount of tools, and material, the total amou
nt of other property, and the location thereof.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by Laws 1988, c. 162, \'a7 50, eff. Jan. 1, 1992.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15664540 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid925797 \rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs40\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218045127}\'a768-2851.  Pipeline companies - Sworn statement or schedule.{\*\bkmkend _Toc218045127}
