\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218045179}\'a768-2897.  Homestead exemption - Laws relating to assessment of property not impaired.{\*\bkmkend _Toc218045179}
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 N
o law relating to homestead exemption shall in any manner affect, alter or impair any law relating to the assessment of property, and each homestead which may be entitled to exemption shall be assessed at its fair cash value, estimated at the price it wou
ld bring at a fair voluntary sale as is provided by law.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by Laws 1988, c. 162, \'a7 97, eff. Jan. 1, 1992.
