\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218045181}\'a768-2899.  County assessor - Report to Tax Commission.{\*\bkmkend _Toc218045181}
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 I
t shall be the duty of each county assessor, on or before June 15 of each year unless delayed by court action or other extraordinary circumstances certified by the Oklahoma Tax Commission, to make a report to the Oklahoma Tax Commission upon forms to be p
rescribed and furnished by the Oklahoma Tax Commission, showing the following information which shall reflect the current balanced records of the county assessor:
\par 1.  Total number of rural homesteads within his county; total number of acres allowed homestea
d exemption; total assessed valuation of rural homesteads before exemption; total amount of exemption allowed on the rural homesteads; and the total assessed valuation of rural homesteads, less exemptions allowed.
\par 2.  Total number of urban homesteads within his county; total number of lots allowed homestead exemption; total assessed valuation of urban homesteads before exemption; total amount of exemption allowed on urban homesteads; and the total assessed valuatio
ns of urban homesteads, less exemptions allowed.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by Laws 1988, c. 162, \'a7 99, eff. Jan. 1, 1992.  Amended by Laws 1989, c. 321, \'a7
