ganized for the purposes therein described, but which districts are incorporated as nonprofit corporations under the provisions of Chapter 13, Oklahoma Session Laws 1968 (Chapter 19, Title 18, O.S. Supp. 1969), shall be exempt from all ad valorem taxation
