eding calendar year, and whose gross household income does not exceed the amount of Twelve Thousand Dollars ($12,000.00) for any calendar year.  The provisions of these sections shall be administered by the Oklahoma Tax Commission, which shall devise and 
furnish appropriate forms for claims, reports of household income, proof of property taxes paid, and such other forms as may be deemed necessary to support claims made pursuant to said sections.
