elief shall exceed Two Hundred Dollars ($200.00).
\par B.  The right to file a claim and to receive property tax relief under the provisions of this act shall be personal to the claimant and shall not survive his death, except that a surviving spouse of the clai
mant may receive benefits hereunder upon the timely filing of a claim.
