urer shall at once issue a tax warrant for the collection thereof, and the sheriff shall forthwith collect it as in other cases; provided, the priority of the tax lien shall be as set forth in Sections 3102 and 3103 of this title.  The person or entity ow
ing such tax, interest and costs shall be civilly liable to any purchaser of such property for any tax, interest and costs owing thereon, but the property so purchased shall be liable in the hands of the purchaser for such tax, interest and costs.  If the
