68-3003.  Revenue from nonrecurrent sources not to be included in political subdivisions estimate of probable income - Exceptions - Exclusion from minimum program income of school districts - Federal funds.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
