\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 T
he county excise board shall meet for the purpose of performing the duties required of it by law as provided by the preceding section, and shall on or before July 25th of each year apportion the millage as authorized by Section 9, Article X, Oklahoma Cons
titution.
