 within the time and in the manner prescribed by rule of the Supreme Court.  The time limit prescribed herein for filing the petition in error may not be extended.  The appeal shall be docketed and determined without cost to either party and the Supreme C
ourt shall, as soon as practicable, set the case for hearing after briefs have been filed under the rules and orders of the Court.
