\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218045352}\'a768-3403.  Notices - Filing.{\*\bkmkend _Toc218045352}
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 A.  Notices of liens, certificates, and other notices affecting federal tax liens or other federal liens must be filed in accordance with the Uniform Federal Lien Registration Act.
\par B.  After any notice required by the Uniform Federal Lien Registration Act to the owner of real property located in the State of Oklahoma, notices of liens upon real property for obligations payable to the United States and certificates and notices affect
ing the liens shall be filed in the office of the county clerk of the county in which the real property subject to the liens is situated.
\par C.  Notices of federal liens upon personal property, whether tangible or intangible, for obligations payable to the United States and certificates and notices affecting the liens shall be filed as follows:
\par 1.  If the person against whose interest the lien applies is a corporation or a partnership whose principal executive office is in this state, as these entities are defined in the internal revenue laws of the United States, in the office of the 
county clerk of Oklahoma County, Oklahoma;
\par 2.  If the person against whose interest the lien applies is a trust that is not covered by paragraph 1 of this subsection, in the office of the county clerk of Oklahoma County, Oklahoma;
\par 3.  If the person against whose interest the lien applies is the estate of a decedent, in the office of the county clerk of Oklahoma County, Oklahoma;
\par 4.  In all other cases, in the office of the county clerk of the county where the person against whose interest the lien applies resides at the time of filing of the notice of lien.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by Laws 1988, c. 132, \'a7 3, eff. Nov. 1, 1988. Renumbered from \'a7
 24302.7 by Laws 1988, c. 162, \'a7 162, eff. Jan. 1, 1992 and Laws 1991, c. 249, \'a7 2, eff. Jan. 1, 1992.
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid925797 \rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs40\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218045353}\'a768-3404.  Certification by U.S. Secretary of Treasury and other officials.{\*\bkmkend _Toc218045353}
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx576\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
