\par b.\tab the cost of construction and operations, wardrobe, accessories and related services,
\par c.\tab the cost of photography, sound synchronization, lighting and related services,
\par d.\tab the cost of editing and related services,
\par e.\tab rental of facilities and equipment,
\par f.\tab other direct costs of producing a film, and
\par g.\tab the wages and salaries of persons who are defined and registered as an Oklahoma Expatriate by the Oklahoma Film and Music Office within the Oklahoma Department of Commerce;
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2896943 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2896943 
