all include documentation from the Tax Commission that repayment has been made as required in this subsection or shall include an affidavit from the production company that the company has not received an exemption from sales tax pursuant to the provision
s of paragraph 23 of Section 1357 of Title 68 of the Oklahoma Statutes.
