\hich\af2\dbch\af41\loch\f2 television production, that serves as strategic retention for the production of live audience epsiodic series in Oklahoma. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \dbch\af41\insrsid11747436\charrsid11747436 
\hich\af2\dbch\af41\loch\f2 
 It is therefore the intent of the Legislature that Oklahoma provide a pilot program incentive specifically for live audience episodic television production in this state, carving out a niche in the industry that Oklahoma can be known for.
