A.  As used in the Bringing Sitcoms Home from Hollywood Pilot Program Act, each of the definitions used in Section 3632 of Title 68 of the Oklahoma Statutes shall have the same meaning for purposes of this act.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af41\loch\f2 B.  In addition to the definitions referenced in subsection A of this section, as used in the Bringing Sitcoms Home from Hollywood Pilot Program Act:
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af41\loch\f2 
