\af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 {\*\bkmkstart _Toc218045424}\'a7}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid9717389 68}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 -}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid9717389 3654}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 .  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid10230303 Issuance of obligations - Calculation of foregone incentives - Payment of proceeds - Repayment - Guaranty.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 
