s title.  The total principal amount of any indebtedness issued by the Authority shall not exceed an amount required in order to allow all establishments 
that have made the disclosure required by subsection A of this section to fully expend proceeds made available to the establishment by the Authority, plus amounts required for repayment of the obligations, if applicable, and the costs of the issuance.}{
