 be deemed to be monies held in trust for the benefit of the Oklahoma Development Finance Authority in order to repay obligations issued by the Authority pursuant to Section 3654 of this title.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
