r Quality Jobs Incentive Act in an amount equal to the net benefit rate multiplied by the actual gross taxable payroll of new direct jobs as verified by the Tax Commission.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi576\li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\tx1296\tx2016\tx2736\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12520440 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid12520440 
