homa Department of Commerce.  The application shall be on a form prescribed by the Department and shall contain such information as may be required by the Department to determine if the applicant is qualified.  The establishment may apply for an effective
 date for a project, which shall not be more than twelve (12) months from the date the application is submitted to the Department.
\par C.  Before approving an application for incentive payments, the Department must first determine that the applicant meets the following requirements:
\par 1.  Be engaged in a basic industry;
\par 2.  Has no more than five hundred full-time employees in this state on the date of application nor an average of more than five hundred full-time employees in this state during the four calendar quarters immediately preceding the date of application;

\par 3.  Has a projected minimum employment, as determined by the Department, of new direct jobs within twelve (12) months of the date of application, or after July 1, 2011, within twenty-four (24) months of the date of application, as follows:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2016\ri0\widctlpar\tx576\tx1296\tx2016\tx2736\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2016\itap0\pararsid12520440 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid12520440 a.\tab 
