\par 1.  Be engaged in a basic industry as defined in the 21st Century Quality Jobs Incentive Act;
\par 2.  Will hire at least ten full-time employees in this state within twelve (12) quarters of the date of application;
\par 3.  Will pay the individuals it employs in new di
