\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 It is the intent of the Legislature that:
\par 1.  The State of Oklahoma provide appropriate incentives to support retention of a qualified manufacturing establishment:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li2016\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2016\itap0\pararsid12406874 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 a.\tab that is imminently at risk of ceasing operations in this state,
