\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 For purposes of the Oklahoma }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid14824826 Specialized}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2773938  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
Quality Investment Act:
\par 1.  \'93Capital costs\'94 means costs for land, buildings, improvements to buildings, fixtures and for machinery, equipment and other personal property used in and for the manufacturing process incurred by a qualified establishment, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid5181968 on or after the effective date of this act}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 , with respect to the manufacturing site located in this state and specified in a quality investment agreement;
\par 2.  \'93Department\'94 means the Oklahoma Department of Commerce;
\par 3.  \'93Qualified establishment\'94
 means a business entity engaged in the activity described by Industry Number 3011, Industry Group Number 301, Major Group 30 of the Standard Industrial Classification manual, latest revision.  No establishment that has been certifie
d as eligible to participate in the Oklahoma Quality Jobs Incentive Leverage Act incentive program shall be eligible for any investment payment pursuant to the Oklahoma }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid14824826 Specialized}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid2773938  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Quality Investment Act. A qualified establishment shall enter into a quality
 investment agrement pertaining to a single manufacturing site as that term is defined in Section 1352 of }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid14824826 this title}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
.  No combination of other locations of an establishment or any related entities of an establishment shall be included in a quality investment agreement.  An establishment may enter into additional quality investment agreements for additional sites;

\par 4.  \'93Fiscal year\'94 means the state fiscal year, which shall begin on July 1 of a calendar year and end on June 30 of the next calendar year;
\par 5.  \'93Quality investment agreement\'94 means an agreement with duration, for purposes of computing the total incentive payment amount, of not more than five (5) years entered into between a qualified establishment and the Department; and
\par 6.  \'93Start date\'94
 means the date on which a qualified establishment begins accruing benefits because of investment of new capital costs in a manufacturing site that is designated in a quality investment agreement with the Oklahoma Department of Commerce.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid535843 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 Added by Laws 2004, c. 391, \'a7
 3, eff. July 1, 2004.  Amended by Laws 2006, c. 1, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 \'a7}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 
