.  All claims for relief authorized by the Sales Tax Relief Act shall be received by and in the possession of the Oklahoma Tax Commission on or before June 30 of each year for sales taxes paid for the preceding calendar year.  Claimants shall be allowed a
 direct credit against income taxes owed by such claimant to the State of Oklahoma for the amount of such claim, in which case such claim shall be filed with the income tax return }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid11812999 
of the claimant}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid1924055  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 on or before April 15 following the close of the taxable year}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid11812999 
