.  In all cases where claimants have no income tax liability or where the sales tax relief authorized by this section exceeds the income tax liability }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436\charrsid11812999 of the claimant}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
