\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 A
.  The in-lieu tax imposed in Section 5401 of this title shall apply on the date of sale or lease and shall be evidenced by a tax stamp.  The tax stamp shall be based on the following actual sales price without reduction for any trade-in:
\par 1.  Beginning with sales of Five Hundred Dollars ($500.00) to One Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($1,999.00):  $6.00;
\par 2.  Two Thousand Dollars ($2,000.00) to Nine Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($9,999.00):  $12.00;
\par 3.  Ten Thousand Dollars ($10,000.00) to Nineteen Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($19,999.00):  $18.00;
\par 4.  Twenty Thousand Dollars ($20,000.00) to Twenty-nine Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($29,999.00):  $24.00;
\par 5.  Thirty Thousand Dollars ($30,000.00) to Thirty-nine Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($39,999.00):  $36.00;
\par 6.  Forty Thousand Dollars ($40,000.00) to Forty-nine Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($49,999.00):  $48.00;
\par 7.  Fifty Thousand Dollars ($50,000.00) to Fifty-nine Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($59,999.00):  $60.00;
\par 8.  Sixty Thousand Dollars ($60,000.00) to Sixty-nine Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($69,999.00):  $72.00;
\par 9.  Seventy Thousand Dollars ($70,000.00) to Seventy-nine Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($79,999.00):  $84.00;
\par 10.  Eighty Thousand Dollars ($80,000.00) to Eighty-nine Thousand Nine Hundred Ninety-nine Dollars ($89,999.00):  $96.00; and
\par 11.  Ninety Thousand Dollars ($90,000.00) and above:  $108.00.
\par B.  The appropriate tax stamp or 
stamps shall be affixed by the dealer to the dealer's copy of the sales invoice covering new or used whole goods agricultural equipment and whole goods attachments thereto sold before transferring ownership to any new or used farm implement.
