ces for approval and payment.  Beginning July 1, 1982, all expenditures from the Fire Marshal Fund shall be made pursuant only to legislat}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11747436 ive appropriation.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2 \ltrch\fcs0 
