ualified purchases as defined in Section 54002 of this title, purchased and that the amount of the state and local use tax claimed was paid to the vendor and no credit, refund, or rebate has been claimed by the contractor or subcontractor.
\par G.  Only sales of tangible personal property made after July 1, 1992, shall be eligible for the refund established by this section.
\par H.  The qualified computer services, data processing or research and development facility shall file, within thirty-six (36) months of the dat
